{
  "notes": [
    "Printed quantities of the client's full 'صفر تا صد' invoices for 3-9 stops (4-6 persons) plus the 5-stop invoices 17784 / 19381. Every other package takes its rows from the same list.",
    "A product that is absent from a list is not part of that package at that stop count (for example the screws-and-plugs row is not printed in 6-stop automatic list 15587).",
    "ropeLength is the number printed in the description of rope 10 (4x24 and so on): 4 persons-6 use 4 x ropeLength, 8 persons use 5 x ropeLength.",
    "rails: counts per rail type. T16 follows T9 until the client gives T16 counts (assumption).",
    "variants: products that exist per stop count (cabin button) or per list (gold floor buttons at 9 stops) replace the standard row."
